    "en": {
      "trackName": "Dialogue: Word Puzzles",
      "description": "A five-letter word is hidden on five rings. Turn the wheels of the lock and tap Try. The pins tell you how many letters are in the right place, never which. You have six tries.\n\nPlay three daily locks: Normal, Hard and Genius. Keep going with Analogue, or make a lock for a friend with a short note sealed inside. Travelogue keeps your record, streaks and keys.\n\nPlay on your wrist or your iPhone. Your personal record follows you across devices using the same iCloud account, including when you switch Watches. Solo puzzles work offline after access is activated, and progress catches up when your devices reconnect.\n\nStart a free 14-day trial through the App Store. After the trial, daily locks, endless play and sending locks require a one-time purchase for a permanent unlock ($4.99 in the U.S.; local prices vary). No subscription, no tracking, no ads, ever. The trial never charges you automatically. Locks you receive remain free.\n\nNo third-party analytics. Support: https://dialogue.arcanealloy.com/support/\nPrivacy: https://dialogue.arcanealloy.com/privacy/",
